WEBVTT

01:34.320 --> 01:36.820
SUSHI Bar

01:35.150 --> 01:36.820
TAMAGO.

01:37.110 --> 01:39.240
His dream of painting SUMI-E dead,

01:39.240 --> 01:44.700
Shigaki went mad after he lost his right arm in a TŌFU PRESS accident.

01:44.700 --> 01:48.960
All hope for him was lost when he was fitted with a cybernetic arm.

01:48.960 --> 01:50.290
TAMAGO.

01:48.960 --> 01:50.290
Insert coins

01:50.290 --> 01:55.720
The arm he was given was a weapon four generations old, the Cyber TEKKO.

01:50.290 --> 01:55.720
NOTE: Do not confuse the TEKKO for a TEKKŌ.

01:56.090 --> 01:59.890
It cost more and more to maintain the TEKKO.

01:59.890 --> 02:03.390
What he earned at the factory was taken by Cyber Doctors.

02:03.390 --> 02:04.020
MAGU—

02:03.390 --> 02:04.020
NOTE: MAGU is short for MAGURO.

02:04.020 --> 02:06.020
Insert coins

02:04.390 --> 02:06.020
No. TAMAGO.

02:08.060 --> 02:10.060
<i>There's no sense in waiting to rot.</i>

02:10.060 --> 02:11.310
<i>I'll find another job.</i>

02:11.310 --> 02:14.070
They say we'll be given BARIKI drinks.

02:11.310 --> 02:14.070
NOTE: BARIKI means HORSEPOWER,
which is less than NINJA POWER.

02:14.070 --> 02:16.860
Really? Do you think anybody's welcome to go?

02:16.860 --> 02:18.400
Hey, you guys.

02:20.370 --> 02:23.240
I want in on that.

02:23.490 --> 02:25.200
What should I do?

02:27.160 --> 02:29.870
RAGE AGAINST TOFU

02:29.870 --> 02:32.090
This is it, Bandit-SAN.

02:32.090 --> 02:33.750
There's nowhere for you to run.

02:33.750 --> 02:35.300
How did you know my name?

02:35.300 --> 02:38.380
Could you be... NINJA Slayer-SAN?

02:38.680 --> 02:41.890
DŌMO, HAJIMEMASHITE.
I am NINJA Slayer.

02:42.220 --> 02:44.220
DŌMO. I am Bandit.

02:44.220 --> 02:44.970
YEEART!

02:44.970 --> 02:46.020
GUUUWAGGHH!

02:46.720 --> 02:48.850
You're going to tell me everything you know.

02:49.140 --> 02:50.350
SAYŌNARA!

02:52.270 --> 02:53.730
He self-destructed!

02:53.730 --> 02:57.780
The secrets of the SŌKAI SYNDICATE vanished into the darkness.

02:58.780 --> 03:00.780
Or did they...?!

03:04.490 --> 03:08.750
Laomoto-SAN, thank you so much for having me here today.

03:11.920 --> 03:18.090
I know we put a lot of strain on your people at Yoroshisan Pharmaceuticals.

03:18.090 --> 03:21.130
By the way, about the TŌFU maker, Sakaiesan...

03:21.130 --> 03:25.720
Is it true that they refused to purchase CLONE YAKUZA?

03:25.720 --> 03:27.140
Yes.

03:27.140 --> 03:31.230
And they've continued to refuse to join our KEIRETSU.

03:27.140 --> 03:31.230
NOTE: KEIRETSU are like ZAIBATSU.

03:31.230 --> 03:35.480
They're trying to monopolize the domestic TŌFU market.

03:35.480 --> 03:39.530
It seems they're unaware of the old wisdom, called INGAOHŌ.

03:40.190 --> 03:44.950
As promised, we'll proceed with the attack on them.

03:44.950 --> 03:49.160
You're capable of providing the required supplies, yes?

03:49.160 --> 03:51.080
With pleasure!

03:51.080 --> 03:55.630
We'll provide five hundred dozen BARIKI drinks

03:55.630 --> 03:58.590
mixed with illegal ZBR ADRENALINE!

03:58.840 --> 04:00.300
Five hundred?

04:00.300 --> 04:01.840
AIYEE!

04:01.840 --> 04:03.300
I'm terribly sorry.

04:03.300 --> 04:06.180
I meant "one thousand dozen!"
That was a typo.

04:06.180 --> 04:09.020
NUHAHAHA!

04:09.350 --> 04:10.850
One thousand!

04:12.810 --> 04:16.060
Did something happen, Dark NINJA?

04:16.480 --> 04:18.610
Bandit-SAN hasn't returned.

04:18.610 --> 04:21.490
The PLAN cannot be allowed to fall behind schedule.

04:18.610 --> 04:21.490
NOTE: PLAN means KEIKAKU.

04:21.490 --> 04:27.830
If he doesn't come back, you must give the mission orders to Beholder.

04:28.200 --> 04:29.080
As you wish.

04:31.790 --> 04:33.830
Attacking a TŌFU plant?

04:33.830 --> 04:36.040
The world's a violent place these days.

04:36.040 --> 04:40.090
Riots against the powers that be are CHAMESHI INCIDENTS.

04:40.090 --> 04:44.010
What's strange is that Sakaiesan TŌFU is the target.

04:44.010 --> 04:47.350
Their 100-yen TŌFU Quartet is super-cheap, and it's four to a pack.

04:47.350 --> 04:50.010
Who knows how many poor people it's kept alive.

04:51.270 --> 04:52.890
Delicious!

04:52.890 --> 04:55.440
Want a drink, Shigaki-SAN?

05:04.610 --> 05:06.860
DŌMO, HAJIMEMASHITE.

05:07.320 --> 05:10.120
My name is Beholder.

05:10.120 --> 05:13.040
I've brought you all here today...

05:13.040 --> 05:18.630
...to exact vengeance on the hateful, hateful Sakaiesan TŌFU company!

05:19.170 --> 05:20.710
Thanks to their run-down factory,

05:21.000 --> 05:23.130
I fell into a generator

05:23.130 --> 05:26.720
and was paralyzed from the waist down!

05:26.720 --> 05:29.470
I was given only a small severance to cover my medical expenses,

05:29.470 --> 05:31.310
and then fired!

05:31.640 --> 05:35.430
I'm told there are many other laborers like me!

05:35.940 --> 05:36.690
I hate them!

05:36.690 --> 05:37.310
What?

05:37.310 --> 05:38.810
NAMU SAN!

05:38.810 --> 05:40.270
He hasn't realized it,

05:40.270 --> 05:43.780
but he's experiencing a chemical reaction

05:43.780 --> 05:47.280
from the illegal drug mixed into his drink, ZBR ADRENALINE!

05:43.780 --> 05:47.280
NOTE: ZBR ADRENALINE promotes STABBING.

05:47.280 --> 05:51.580
Sakaiesan TŌFU s a dark megacorp!

05:47.660 --> 05:47.990
HATE

05:49.660 --> 05:49.990
RAGE

05:51.580 --> 05:57.250
Their super-cheap TŌFU contains carcinogens
and additives that make your brain shrink!

05:57.250 --> 06:02.250
When the audience hears this, their cerebral chemical reactions begin to peak!

06:08.260 --> 06:12.560
<i>My SUMI-E were... so worthless, so unimaginative!</i>

06:13.260 --> 06:16.230
<i>During the raid on the TŌFU plant,
I shall become an ONI!</i>

06:16.230 --> 06:19.900
<i>I shall draw what I see in my SUMI-E paintings!</i>

06:22.480 --> 06:25.030
Oh my. There's a riot outside.

06:25.030 --> 06:27.450
That time of year already, huh?

06:27.450 --> 06:28.570
I know!

06:28.860 --> 06:31.910
Let's play a shooting game, to see who's more ruthless.

06:31.910 --> 06:33.200
That's a good idea.

06:33.620 --> 06:35.870
After all, they're in checkmate.

06:33.620 --> 06:35.870
NOTE: CHECKMATE occurs in GAMES.

06:35.870 --> 06:38.210
TŌFU

06:41.460 --> 06:43.170
ᗅᗺᗷᗅ!

06:43.170 --> 06:44.050
A NINJA?

06:44.380 --> 06:46.170
No, is that Beholder-SAN?

06:46.590 --> 06:49.680
Did he put a turbo engine in his wheelchair?

06:52.260 --> 06:55.470
SPEAK

06:53.720 --> 06:55.680
.thgiliwT nmutuA

06:55.470 --> 06:56.930
OPEN

07:00.900 --> 07:02.400
Screw you, asshole!

07:05.780 --> 07:10.030
Beholder has the power of KANASHIBARI JUTSU,

07:10.030 --> 07:12.820
the ability to hypnotize with his gaze alone!

07:16.870 --> 07:18.790
Where's Beholder-SAN?

07:18.790 --> 07:20.120
I must protect him.

07:26.050 --> 07:27.630
YEEART!

07:28.420 --> 07:29.420
UWAAARRGGH!

07:37.350 --> 07:39.640
Die, motherfucker!

07:39.640 --> 07:41.390
YEEART!

07:48.650 --> 07:50.700
Marvelous!

07:52.660 --> 07:57.640
<i>Instead of SUMI-E, should I have studied KARATE?</i>

07:59.250 --> 08:01.660
<i>If the security lock is disabled,</i>

08:01.660 --> 08:04.920
<i>I should be able to use the direct elevator at the central guard tower.</i>

08:04.920 --> 08:07.040
AIEYYEHhhh...

08:07.040 --> 08:08.590
YEEART!

08:14.680 --> 08:16.470
Are you part of the Sakaie clan?

08:16.470 --> 08:18.010
Yes, we are!

08:18.010 --> 08:20.220
Listen, guys.

08:20.220 --> 08:21.980
Just let me hit you once.

08:21.980 --> 08:25.020
Yes, if you'll let us go afterward!

08:25.520 --> 08:26.520
YEEART!

08:26.520 --> 08:28.940
AIEYYEHHHhhhh...

08:29.610 --> 08:31.690
<i>Did you know?</i>

08:32.030 --> 08:36.070
<i>My TEKKO is so old, I can't control its strength.</i>

08:37.070 --> 08:39.580
<i>The job's done.</i>

08:39.580 --> 08:43.460
<i>I'll use this money to buy the latest cybernetic arm.</i>

08:43.460 --> 08:45.880
<i>I'm saying goodbye to all this violence.</i>

08:47.210 --> 08:48.710
Marvelous.

08:48.710 --> 08:50.840
What ruthlessness!

08:50.840 --> 08:54.680
Would you like to be a SŌKAI YAKUZA?

08:50.840 --> 08:54.680
NOTE: SŌKAI YAKUZA are less cool than SŌKAIYA NINJA.

08:55.090 --> 09:00.560
<i>Wasn't Beholder-SAN a disgruntled TŌFU company employee?</i>

09:00.560 --> 09:03.020
<i>SŌKAI YAKUZA? He's a YAKUZA?</i>

09:03.520 --> 09:04.850
Please let me go!

09:04.850 --> 09:08.190
I'm just a down-on-his-luck laborer who wants to be a SUMI-E painter!

09:09.820 --> 09:11.730
Raise your head.

09:14.700 --> 09:16.200
AIEYYEH!

09:16.200 --> 09:19.580
Stand! If you won't be a YAKUZA,
you'll just have to die!

09:19.580 --> 09:21.620
AIEYYEH!

09:21.620 --> 09:24.580
Save me! AHHHHHHHH!

09:25.250 --> 09:26.620
WASSHOI!

09:27.580 --> 09:29.460
Who are you?

09:29.790 --> 09:32.460
DŌMO. I am NINJA Slayer.

09:32.710 --> 09:35.050
DŌMO. I am Beholder.

09:35.050 --> 09:36.130
YEEART!

09:39.390 --> 09:41.100
GUWAAARGHH!

09:41.100 --> 09:42.100
YEEART!

09:44.020 --> 09:45.350
GWUHH!

09:45.680 --> 09:47.980
Now, show me who you really are!

09:51.860 --> 09:56.110
Take off your hood and mask with your own hands!

09:57.660 --> 09:58.530
YEEART!

09:58.530 --> 09:59.320
What?

10:00.830 --> 10:01.740
GUWAAARGHH!

10:03.240 --> 10:04.290
Impossible.

10:04.290 --> 10:06.330
He defeated my KANASHIBARI JUTSU?

10:06.330 --> 10:09.630
Was I wrong to attempt to capture him alive?

10:11.920 --> 10:14.710
What a fool you are, Fujikido!

10:14.710 --> 10:16.050
What did you say?

10:16.050 --> 10:20.720
His evil eye gives him a powerful KANASHIBARI JUTSU,

10:20.720 --> 10:23.390
and he'll use it to kill you instantly.

10:23.390 --> 10:26.480
Give me your body.

10:26.480 --> 10:27.480
I refuse!

10:27.480 --> 10:30.980
Do you not desire revenge?

10:30.980 --> 10:31.810
Go!

10:31.810 --> 10:34.570
Crush him into NEGITORO!

10:31.810 --> 10:34.570
NOTE: NINJAS are not fond of NEGITORO SUSHI.

10:34.570 --> 10:36.110
AIEYYEH!

10:39.360 --> 10:40.870
YEEART!

10:43.580 --> 10:45.950
AIEYYEEEeeeEEEeehhHH!

10:47.540 --> 10:52.130
You're next, young fool of the Cobra NINJA Clan!

10:52.540 --> 10:54.340
There will be no mercy for you.

10:54.340 --> 10:57.380
Now I shall show you the true world of the NINJA!

10:58.670 --> 11:01.510
YEEEEAAART!

11:02.140 --> 11:03.140
HYAHH?

11:03.140 --> 11:03.930
YEEART!

11:04.310 --> 11:06.680
The KANASHIBARI JUTSU is defeated!

11:06.680 --> 11:09.390
No man has eyes in the back of his head!

11:09.390 --> 11:11.480
This is the true world of the NINJA!

11:11.480 --> 11:12.730
AIEYYEH?!

11:15.980 --> 11:17.940
GUWAAARGHH!

11:20.450 --> 11:22.280
Where are the rest of the SIX GATES?

11:22.280 --> 11:24.830
Bandit-SAN is missing.

11:24.830 --> 11:26.240
I killed him.

11:26.240 --> 11:27.200
AIEYYAH!

11:27.200 --> 11:29.250
Huge SHURIKEN-SAN and Earthquake-SAN

11:29.250 --> 11:31.870
have been ordered to find the Dragon DŌJŌ and burn it down!

11:32.290 --> 11:34.630
Hellkite-SAN was flying around nearby,

11:34.630 --> 11:37.250
but he's probably already headed to his next mission.

11:37.250 --> 11:40.220
I don't know where Daedalus-SAN-TACHI are.

11:40.220 --> 11:41.760
That's all I know!

11:42.050 --> 11:43.340
I see.

11:43.340 --> 11:44.550
Then one last thing.

11:44.550 --> 11:47.720
Several months ago, at the
Marunouchi SUGOI Tall Building...

11:44.550 --> 11:47.720
NOTE: SUGOI means VERY.

11:47.720 --> 11:52.270
Which NINJA killed the SALARYMAN,
Fujikido Kenji, along with his wife and child?

11:52.270 --> 11:53.400
UWAHH! I don't know!

11:53.400 --> 11:57.480
But if you're talking about the fight at
Marunouchi several months ago it was probably...

11:57.480 --> 11:58.440
Dark NIN—

11:58.440 --> 12:00.610
UWAAAARGH!

12:00.610 --> 12:01.700
SAYŌNARA!

12:06.490 --> 12:07.830
YEEART!
